        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>云南各地美食</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #61C0A4;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .document {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    background-color: transparent;\n  }\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: inline-block;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .title::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -5%;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    width: 110%;\n    height: 8px;\n    background-color: #e73828;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    z-index: -1;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .city-badge {\n    background-color: #fdf3d0;\n    color: #000;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .food-item {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .food-name {\n    color: #c8281f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"title\">云南各地美食</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"city-badge\">昆明</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">小锅米线：</span>昆明，米线种类众多，当首推小锅米线，还有一种砂锅米线</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">汽锅鸡：</span>这个汤不是直接加的水，也就是说这个锅里原来只有鸡肉和作料，一点水不加。那汤是哪来的呢？水蒸气</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">过桥米线：</span>不能算昆明小吃，应该在蒙自。连最有名的桥香园总店也是在蒙自</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"city-badge\">大理</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">饵丝：</span>比煎饼果子好吃！其实没什么可比性。可以加些菜，香肠鸡蛋什么的。酱可以选择咸的或者甜的</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">凉鸡米线：</span>将做好的白斩鸡撕成条，拌入米线里，加入梅子醋和调料，最后浇上一勺卤子水，入口酸甜爽滑</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">乳扇：</span>能煎能炸、能烩能炒，还能卷成筒状内塞馅料。本地常吃的方法是用菜油煎黄后，撒盐或白糖食用</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"city-badge\">丽江</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">鸡豌豆凉粉：</span>豆经碾磨成粉条，灰绿色，煎炸凉拌都很入味</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">酥油茶：</span>分甜咸两种口味，可以试试</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">鸡豆凉粉：</span>口感爽滑细腻，既可以凉吃也可以热吃，凉粉上加入红辣椒、花椒、青葱酸醋等作料，很是美味</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">丽江粑粑：</span>加入火腿、油、糖等材料制作成的盘子大小“千层饼”似的圆饼</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"city-badge\">香格里拉</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">糌粑：</span>它是青稞麦炒熟、磨细、不过筛的炒面</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">迪庆坨坨肉：</span>迪庆彝族的主要煮肉形式。将猪肉或羊、牛肉，不放佐料用冷水煮熟</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">奶渣：</span>奶渣从牛奶中提制而成。用酥油煎奶渣加红糖而成的煎奶渣是藏家人待客常用的一道菜</div>\n      <div class=\"food-item\"><span class=\"food-name\">中甸酸奶：</span>用提炼过酥油的奶制作的，适合老人和小孩食用</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
